# **CAMP AFRO FOLI DATES RELEASED!**

Get ready to immerse yourself in the rhythms and movements of West African drum and dance at our 3-day camp, featuring international and local artists who will share their skills and create magic on the Sunshine Coast - stay tuned for exciting artist announcements coming soon!
